    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-03-31</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        /* Header Styles */\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 5px 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        header .header-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .date {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        /* Main Content Layout */\n        main {\n            padding: 15px 10px;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n        }\n\n        /* Section Styles */\n        section {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 12px;\n        }\n\n        section h2 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 12pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        /* Empty State */\n        .empty-state {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-style: italic;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        /* Product/Update Item Styles */\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dotted #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            padding-bottom: 0;\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        /* Tags */\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin: 2px 4px 2px 0;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-family: Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n        }\n\n        .tag.feature {\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .tag.bugfix {\n            background-color: #fff0f0;\n            color: #c00;\n        }\n\n        .tag.security {\n            background-color: #fff8e8;\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .tag.release {\n            background-color: #f0f8ff;\n            color: #0066cc;\n        }\n\n        /* Footer */\n        footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            padding: 15px 10px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        /* Responsive Design */\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            header .header-content {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                align-items: flex-start;\n                gap: 5px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Print Styles */\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                break-inside: avoid;\n                border: 1px solid #000;\n            }\n\n            a {\n                color: #000000;\n                text-decoration: underline;\n            }\n\n            .tag {\n                border: 1px solid #000;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Utility */\n        .highlight {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        code {\n            font-family: Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            padding: 2px 4px;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">2026-03-31</div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- Left Column: New Products -->\n            <section class=\"new-products\">\n                <h2>New Products</h2>\n                <div class=\"empty-state\">\n                    No new products found in this research cycle.\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Middle Column: Whitelist Updates -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Whitelist Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases/tag/v1.3.38-vscode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Continue v1.3.38 (VSCode)\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added support for .continue/configs directory, filtered session history by workspace directory, and improved configuration handling with enhanced dependency updates.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">release</span>\n                        <span>2026-03-27</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases/tag/v1.0.67-jetbrains\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Continue v1.0.67 (JetBrains)\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Fixed Winston logger stream corruption, improved config.yaml handling, and added session history filtering by workspace with dependency security patches.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag release\">release</span>\n                        <span>2026-03-27</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases/tag/v1.3.37-vscode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Continue v1.3.37 (VSCode)\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Removed Ollama template-based tool support gate and resolved JetBrains compatibility issues with improved dependency management.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag bugfix\">bugfix</span>\n                        <span>2026-03-26</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases/tag/v1.3.36-vscode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Continue v1.3.36 (VSCode)\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Resolved critical security vulnerabilities, added ModelDescription type callbacks, and fixed StringIndexOutOfBoundsException with improved error handling.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag security\">security</span>\n                        <span>2026-03-26</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/#announcements-v0350---2026-03-24\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Gemini CLI v0.35.0\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Introduced customizable keyboard shortcuts with Kitty protocol support, improved Vim mode with yank/paste operations, added Linux sandboxing with bubblewrap/seccomp, and implemented JIT context discovery.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-03-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/#announcements-v0340---2026-03-17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            Gemini CLI v0.34.0\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enabled Plan Mode by default for systematic task breakdown, added native gVisor and LXC container sandboxing support for safer execution environments.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-03-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Technical Insights -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>Technical Insights</h2>\n                <div class=\"empty-state\">\n                    No new insights gathered in this research cycle.\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n        <p>Report generated by <a href=\"https://github.com/agentdaily\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agent Code Daily</a> - Powered by <a href=\"https://claude.com/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Agent SDK</a></p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 8px; font-size: 8pt;\">Generated: 2026-03-31 | <a href=\"#\">Archives</a> | <a href=\"#\">About</a></p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
